* AD8237 Instrumentation Amplifier
V1 VCC 0 5
V2 VREF 0 2.5
V4 IN_M 0 2.5
V3 IN IN_M SINE(0 20m 1k) AC 1

* Gain = 1 + R2/R1 = 1 + 9k/1k = 10 (20 dB)
R1 FB VREF 1k
R2 OUT FB 9k

* AD8237 Subcircuit Pin Order: BW INM INP VSN REF VOUT FB VSP
X1 VCC IN_M IN 0 VREF OUT FB VCC AD8237

.tran 5m
.ac dec 10 10 100k
.end
